`Tracking` and `EntryStatus` only need to be public because `V4ManifestReader` reads tracking through `ManifestFile`. Most `ManifestFile` implementations return no tracking, so the new method would be null for them anyway.

Suggest keeping this internal until we have more clear picture about the public APIs later. Add a package-private helper in `TrackedFileAdapters` and call it from `Builder.build()`:

```java
static Tracking tracking(ManifestFile manifest) {
  return manifest instanceof TrackedManifestFile tracked ? tracked.file().tracking() : null;
}
```

Then `ManifestFile`, `Tracking`, and `EntryStatus` stay unchanged.

